{"sourceUrl":"https://pmc.whu.edu.cn/info/1089/172551.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:52:28.283277+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://pmc.whu.edu.cn/info/1089/172551.htm","html":"<div>\n<p><span><span>为做好</span><span>202</span></span><span>7</span><span><span>年接收应届本科毕业生免试攻读研究生（包括直博生和硕士生，以下简称</span><span>“推免生”）工作，进一步提高生源质量，更好地为学生服务，</span></span><span>学</span><span>院现</span><span>开展推免生接收预报名工作</span><span>，热忱欢迎推免生申报</span><span>武汉大学</span><span>动力与机械学院研究生。</span></p><p><strong><span>一、接收学科专业和专业类别</span></strong></p><table><tbody><tr><td><br/></td><td><p><strong><span><span>学科专业</span><span>/专业类别</span></span></strong></p></td><td colspan=\"2\"><p><strong><span>申请类型</span></strong></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"5\"><p><strong><span>学术学位</span></strong></p></td><td><p><span>080200机械工程</span></p></td><td><p><span>推免直博</span></p></td><td><p><span>推免硕士</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>080500材料科学与工程</span></p></td><td><p><span>推免直博</span></p></td><td><p><span>推免硕士</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>080700动力工程及工程热物理</span></p></td><td><p><span>推免直博</span></p></td><td><p><span>推免硕士</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>0807Z2能源动力水质工程</span></p></td><td><p><span>推免直博</span></p></td><td><p><span>∕</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>0808Z2电力建设与运营</span></p></td><td><p><span>推免直博</span></p></td><td><p><span>∕</span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"2\"><p><strong><span>专业学位</span></strong></p></td><td><p><span>085500机械</span></p></td><td><p><span><span>推免直博</span><span>(国家专项)</span></span></p></td><td><p><span>推免硕士</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>085800能源动力</span></p></td><td><p><span><span>推免直博</span><span>(国家专项)</span></span></p></td><td><p><span>推免硕士</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong><span>二</span></strong><strong><span>、申请条件</span></strong></p><p><span>1.拥护中国共产党领导</span><span>，热爱祖国，品德良好，遵纪守法，身心健康</span><span>。</span></p><p><span>2.预计可获</span><span>得所在学校</span><span>的</span><span>推免生资格</span><span>。</span></p><p><span>3.</span><span>诚实守信、学风端正。本科期间无任何剽窃他人学术成果以及其他违法违纪受处分记录，并在研究生入学前</span><span>取</span><span>得学位</span><span>证书和</span><span>毕业证书。</span></p><p><strong><span>三</span></strong><strong><span>、</span></strong><strong><span>工作</span></strong><strong><span>安排</span></strong></p><p><span>（</span><span>一</span><span>）</span><span>网上申请</span></p><p><span>202</span><span>6</span><span><span>年</span><span>9月</span></span><span>4</span><span>日</span><span>—</span><span>9月8</span><span>日</span><span>，申请人</span><span><span>登录推免预报名系统（</span><span>yz.whu.edu.cn）</span></span><span>，</span><span>根据系统内要求填报信息</span><span>，</span><span>并</span><span>上传材料</span><span>：</span></p><p><span>1.</span><span>有效身份证明（二代居民身份证）</span><span>；</span></p><p><span>2.</span><span>学信网《教育部学籍在线验证报告》</span><span>；</span></p><p><span>3.本科成绩单和专业排名证明；</span></p><p><span>4.国家英语四、六级考试成绩或TOEFL/GRE/GMAT/IELTS成绩等体现自身外语水平的证明；</span></p><p><span>5.</span><span>科研成果</span><span>和获</span><span>奖证明等</span><span>；</span></p><p><span>6.申请直博者须提交两份专家推荐信，推荐专家须为报考学科专业相关的教授或相当专业技术职称的专家。</span></p><p><span>（二）资格审核</span></p><p><span>202</span><span>6</span><span><span>年</span><span>9月</span></span><span>9</span><span>日</span><span>—</span><span>9月11</span><span>日</span><span>，</span><span>学院</span><span>根据申请人提交的申请材料，进行</span><span>资格审核</span><span>，按</span><span>申请类型、学科专业/专业类别</span><span>择优确定考核名单（</span><strong><span>优先考虑志愿一，请谨慎填报志愿</span></strong><span>），并通过推免预报名系统发布审核结果。</span><strong><span><span>审核通过的学生请实名加入</span><span>QQ群：1107897807。</span></span></strong></p><p><span>（</span><span>三</span><span>）</span><span>综合考核</span></p><p><span>202</span><span>6</span><span><span>年</span><span>9月</span></span><span>15</span><span>日</span><span>—</span><span>9月16</span><span>日</span><span>，</span><span><span>按学科</span><span>/专业类别分组考核。</span></span></p><p><span>1.考核内容</span></p><p><span>考核包括背景评估、综合面试两部分：</span></p><p><span><span>背景评估：根据申请人提交的申请材料进行评估，包括考生的教育背景、学习成绩及平均绩点（</span><span>GPA）、成绩排名、科研能力等。</span></span></p><p><span>综合面试：包括外语水平测试及专业面试，主要考查考生对专业基础知识的理解与掌握，综合运用所学知识分析解决问题的能力、表达能力、专业技能、培养潜力、外语水平、治学态度、心理素质等。</span></p><p><span>2.具体考核安排另行通知。</span></p><p><span>3.成绩计算：各项成绩均为百分制。</span></p><p><span><span>综合成绩</span> <span>＝</span> <span>背景评估</span><span>×30% ＋综合面试×70%。</span></span></p><p><strong><span>四、其他重要说明</span></strong></p><p><span>1.所有通过预推免考核、并确认结果的考生，须在规定时间内，登录教育部推免系统（开通时间详见中国研招网公告），完成志愿填报等工作。</span><strong><span><span>教育部推免系统中的结果为</span><span>2027年推免生正式录取结果。</span></span></strong></p><p><span>2.学院2027年硕士招生专业目录以国家推免服务系统和我校研究生院网站公布的专业目录信息为准。</span></p><p><strong><span>五</span></strong><strong><span>、联系方式</span></strong></p><p><span>武汉大学</span><span>动力与机械学院</span><span><span>教学办公室</span>  </span></p><p><span>联系</span><span><span>电话：</span><span>027-687</span></span><span>7</span><span>2271（工作时间开通）</span></p><p><span>电子邮箱</span><span>：</span><a href=\"mailto:jiejin2006@whu.edu.cn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>jiejin2006@whu.edu.cn</span></a><span>。</span></p><p><br/></p><p><span>武汉大学动力与机械学院</span></p><p><span>        <span>202</span></span><span>6</span><span><span>年</span><span>9月</span></span><span>3</span><span><span>日</span> </span></p><p><br/></p>\n</div>","textSha256":"3894c6513d2ad9c5e7038cce201354be2fda3e500c380f7efbc76269ae67a957","textLength":1270,"sourceSha256":"4f9b67006ede80cb41870b486fbe51049805ec4ec1ec767986771933c42566dd","selector":".v_news_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-7b1e0ca945f5ce3730d3","title":"2026年武汉大学动力与机械学院2027年推免生接收预报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:52:28.283277+00:00"}
